      "message": "Not a formally documented guideline, but it is the established PDI convention in this repo for uint64 inventory properties where the value may be unavailable; the same pattern is used by Inventory.Item.Accelerator for BaseSpeedInHz, MaxSpeedInHz, and MinSpeedInHz. If a sdbusplus-based service implements this interface but never explicitly sets PowerCapacityWatts, the property will automatically report UINT64_MAX on D-Bus",
