      "writtenOn": "2026-10-07T19:35:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was discussed with Patrick and Alexander in the earlier patchsets (if you scroll up). The concern was that adding a property to Item.PowerSupply requires all existing producers of that interface (notably entity-manager) to be updated, leaving the interface definition out of sync with what\u0027s actually on D-Bus. A Decorator is opt-in. The broader name PowerAttributes was suggested to accommodate potential future properties.",
